OL,3,AMansion featured in Rivals drops price
OL,4,Aby #1.5m after failing to sell
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mansion that is home to Danny Dyer's
OL,7,Fcharacter on Disney+ series Rivals has
OL,8,Fdropped in price by #1.5m after failing
OL,9,Fto woo buyers.
OL,11,FThe house, called Bella Vista on the
OL,12,Fshow, is in Lisvane, Cardiff, and was
OL,13,Fput up for sale with an #8m price tag
OL,14,Fin May before estate agents reduced it
OL,15,Fto #6.5m this month.
OL,17,FBased on one of Dame Jilly Cooper's
OL,18,Fso-called "bonkbuster" novels, Rivals
OL,19,Ffeatures an all-star cast including
OL,20,FDavid Tennant and Emily Atack, and more
OL,21,Fepisodes of season two were released on
OL,22,FWednesday.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
